{
  "about": "The free music and sound effects bundled with Clips Kitty (video/audio_library.py). Everything here is CC0 1.0 (public domain dedication): free to use, also in monetised videos, with no credit needed. Sound effects are unmodified files from Kenney's audio packs, each pack's own License.txt beside them as LICENSE.txt. Music is by HoliznaCC0, from the Free Music Archive; each track has a LICENSE.txt that records the licence sentence on its page, and \"changes\" says how the file was cut and encoded. A mood or category is a label for the picker, chosen from the source's own name and genre. tests/test_audio_library.py checks every file against its sha256 and size.",
